{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35869","headline":"和友人喜相遇十首 七 · 李咸用","name":"和友人喜相遇十首 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松桂寒多衆木分，轻浮如叶自纷纭。\n韶咸古曲教谁爱，山水清音喜独闻。\n上国共知传大宝，旧交宁复在青云。\n相逢莫厌杯中酒，同醉同醒秪有君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35869.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35869","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}